6.3.evidence:
For women workers:
1. obtain leave/rest for 1.5 (one and a half) months before the time of childbirth and 1.5 (one and a half) months after childbirth ... while still receiving wages or salary ...;
2. obtain leave/rest for 1.5 (one and a half) months in the event of a miscarriage while still receiving wages or salary ...;
3. obtain appropriate opportunities to provide breast milk to her child if this must be done during working hours, while still receiving wages or salary ...
